dsh-profile-lab README · A. host 面：装配 + 工具面 + 会话行为：tmpprofile_create  { name: "probeA", template: "headless", purpose: "验证 dsh-xxx 的工具面", packages: ["link:C:/plugins/dsh-xxx"] }
tmpprofile_run     { name: "probeA", task: "只回复两个字：OK" }
tmpprofile_session { name: "probeA", sections: ["preset","tools","contexts"] }

dsh-profile-lab README · B. 渲染 / HTTP 面：起真实例，探插件的 host 路由：tmpprofile_create    { name: "webA", template: "web", packages: ["link:C:/plugins/dsh-xxx"] }
tmpprofile_web_start { name: "webA", probePath: "/api/dsh-xxx/status" }
tmpprofile_web_stop  { name: "webA" }

tmpprofile_clean   { names: ["probeA", "webA"], confirm: true }
```
